odize my recovery, but my stress isn't gone. Due to my Fs in that course, I'm second guessing myself. I have an interview this coming Tuesday to be a research assistant and have to submit a writing sample and I feel inadequate. Even though I get really high marks on my papers in my field. \\n\\nI feel like I'm not allowed to be proud of myself. To be optimistic or excited. I feel like I have to be hard on myself instead of encouraging. I sound delusional asking if I'm being too hard on myself because I know the answer... But I can't let myself believe it.\"\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"status\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"category\",\n        \"num_unique_values\": 7,\n        \"samples\": [\n          \"Normal\",\n          \"Stress\",\n          \"Bipolar\"\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"count\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 0,\n        \"min\": 2,\n        \"max\": 22,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 12,\n        \"samples\": [\n          3,\n          4,\n          22\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"}},"metadata":{},"execution_count":12}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["## Drop Duplicates\n","df_MH = df.drop_duplicates(subset=['statement', 'status'], keep='first')\n"],"metadata":{"id":"6cs-u_RMmPo8","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1763858849491,"user_tz":480,"elapsed":153,"user":{"displayName":"Monica Martin","userId":"10214485714780845175"}}},"execution_count":13,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["df_MH['status'].value_counts()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":334},"id":"kWwcbYloRx8b","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1763858849579,"user_tz":480,"elapsed":71,"user":{"displayName":"Mo